OL,3,GNEWSAMajor gas works stopped amid
OL,4,Atraffic delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA massive scheme to replace underground
OL,7,Fgas pipes in a Devon town has been
OL,8,Fpulled after roadworks caused drivers
OL,9,Fto be stuck in traffic for hours.
OL,11,FWales and West Utilities began a second
OL,12,Fphase of work in Barnstaple on Monday
OL,13,Fbut drivers were caught up in traffic
OL,14,Fjams around the town.
OL,16,FA spokesman for the firm said: "Due to
OL,17,Fthe unprecedented impact on local
OL,18,Ftransport, and with schools due to
OL,19,Freturn next week, we have taken the
OL,20,Fdecision to suspend our works to reduce
OL,21,Ftraffic congestion in the area."
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
