OL,3,GNEWSAMajor gas works stopped amid
OL,4,Atraffic delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales and West apologised for the
OL,7,Fdisruption and said the work would now
OL,8,Fbe "put on hold, and re-planned at a
OL,9,Flater date following further
OL,10,Fconsultation".
